  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen the capacity of Agriculture Knowledge Centre (AKC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the assignment is to build the capacity of AKC and VHLSEC on climate change discourse to support the integration of NDC and NAP priorities into agriculture plans and budgets in Nepal. This will be done through providing orientation to stakeholders, and by providing training to agriculture and livestock frontline official, Agri stakeholders, and private entities in Nepal with comprehensive knowledge of climate change discourse.</narrative>
  </description>
